From 20b94286b18db623a9709b6048aca6d5b5e21fbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Zhao <kevin.zhao@linaro.org>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 03:05:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Support text-only Qwen3.5 W4A8 on CPU

Skip quantization of the unloaded vision tower, preserve reshaped GDN convolution weights, and make hybrid KV-cache sizing honor native CPU attention alignment. The confirmed runtime failures were construction of an excluded vision tower and a 16-aligned hybrid block passed to a 32-aligned CPU attention kernel.\n\nAssisted-by: OpenAI Codex
---
